#: ../../library/stm.rst:4
msgid ":mod:`stm` --- functionality specific to STM32 MCUs"
msgstr ":mod:`stm` --- functionaliteit specifiek voor STM32-MCU's"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:9
msgid ""
"This module provides functionality specific to STM32 microcontrollers, "
"including direct access to peripheral registers."
msgstr ""
"Deze module biedt functionaliteit die specifiek is voor "
"STM32-microcontrollers, waaronder directe toegang tot randapparaatregisters."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:13
msgid "Memory access"
msgstr "Geheugentoegang"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:15
msgid ""
"The module exposes three subscriptable objects used for raw memory access. "
"Each behaves like a sparse array indexed by byte address: ``value = "
"memN[addr]`` reads, ``memN[addr] = value`` writes. The address is always a "
"byte address, regardless of the access width."
msgstr ""
"De module stelt drie subscriptbare objecten beschikbaar voor ruwe "
"geheugentoegang. Elk gedraagt zich als een schaarse array geïndexeerd op "
"byteadres: ``value = memN[addr]`` leest, ``memN[addr] = value`` schrijft. "
"Het adres is altijd een byteadres, ongeacht de toegangsbreedte."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:20
msgid ""
"These memory objects can be used in combination with the peripheral register"
" constants below to read and write MCU hardware peripheral registers, as "
"well as any other location in the SoC's address space."
msgstr ""
"Deze geheugenobjecten kunnen worden gebruikt in combinatie met de hieronder "
"beschreven randapparaatregisterconstanten om hardware-randapparaatregisters "
"van de MCU te lezen en te schrijven, evenals elke andere locatie in de "
"adresruimte van de SoC."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:26
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 8-bit memory accessor. ``mem8[addr]`` reads an ``int`` in the "
"range 0-255 from the byte at ``addr``; ``mem8[addr] = value`` writes the low"
" 8 bits of ``value``. ``addr`` may be any byte-aligned address."
msgstr ""
"Subscriptbare 8-bit geheugentoegang. ``mem8[addr]`` leest een ``int`` in het"
" bereik 0-255 uit de byte op ``addr``\\ ; ``mem8[addr] = value`` schrijft de"
" laagste 8 bits van ``value``\\ . ``addr`` mag elk byte-uitgelijnd adres "
"zijn."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:32
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 16-bit (halfword) memory accessor. ``mem16[addr]`` reads an "
"``int`` in the range 0-65535; ``mem16[addr] = value`` writes the low 16 "
"bits. ``addr`` must be aligned to 2 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Subscriptbare 16-bit (halfwoord) geheugentoegang. ``mem16[addr]`` leest een "
"``int`` in het bereik 0-65535; ``mem16[addr] = value`` schrijft de laagste "
"16 bits. ``addr`` moet uitgelijnd zijn op 2 bytes."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:38
msgid ""
"Subscriptable 32-bit (word) memory accessor. ``mem32[addr]`` reads an "
"``int`` in the range 0-0xFFFFFFFF; ``mem32[addr] = value`` writes the low 32"
" bits. ``addr`` must be aligned to 4 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Subscriptbare 32-bit (woord) geheugentoegang. ``mem32[addr]`` leest een "
"``int`` in het bereik 0-0xFFFFFFFF; ``mem32[addr] = value`` schrijft de "
"laagste 32 bits. ``addr`` moet uitgelijnd zijn op 4 bytes."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:44
msgid "Peripheral register constants"
msgstr "Randapparaatregisterconstanten"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:46
msgid ""
"The :mod:`stm` module exposes the full set of CMSIS register addresses and "
"offsets for whichever STM32 family the firmware was compiled for. The names "
"mirror ST's CMSIS headers exactly: ``STM32F427xx``, ``STM32F765xx``, "
"``STM32H743xx`` and ``STM32N657xx`` on the M4, M7, H7 family (H7 / H7 Plus /"
" Pure Thermal) and N6 OpenMV Cams respectively. The full set of names is "
"several hundred symbols per family (271 on M4, 306 on M7, 494 on H7, 594 on "
"N6); enumerating them here would simply duplicate ST's reference manual and "
"CMSIS headers."
msgstr ""
"De :mod:`stm`\\ -module stelt de volledige set CMSIS-registeradressen en "
"-offsets beschikbaar voor de STM32-familie waarvoor de firmware is "
"gecompileerd. De namen weerspiegelen exact ST's CMSIS-headers: "
"``STM32F427xx``\\ , ``STM32F765xx``\\ , ``STM32H743xx`` en ``STM32N657xx`` "
"op respectievelijk de M4-, M7-, H7-familie (H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal) en "
"N6 OpenMV Cams. De volledige set namen omvat enkele honderden symbolen per "
"familie (271 op M4, 306 op M7, 494 op H7, 594 op N6); ze hier opsommen zou "
"simpelweg ST's referentiehandleiding en CMSIS-headers dupliceren."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:55
msgid "Two naming conventions are used:"
msgstr "Er worden twee naamgevingsconventies gebruikt:"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:57
msgid ""
"Constants named after a peripheral instance (``GPIOA``, ``USART1``, "
"``TIM2``, ...) are **absolute base addresses**."
msgstr ""
"Constanten die zijn vernoemd naar een randapparaatinstantie (\\ ``GPIOA``\\ "
", ``USART1``\\ , ``TIM2``\\ , ...) zijn **absolute basisadressen**\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:59
msgid ""
"Constants prefixed with a peripheral type (``GPIO_BSRR``, ``USART_CR1``, "
"``TIM_CCR1``, ...) are **register offsets** relative to the matching base."
msgstr ""
"Constanten met een randapparaattype als voorvoegsel (\\ ``GPIO_BSRR``\\ , "
"``USART_CR1``\\ , ``TIM_CCR1``\\ , ...) zijn **registeroffsets** ten "
"opzichte van de bijbehorende basis."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:62
msgid ""
"Add an absolute base and a register offset to get the full address of a "
"single register. For example ``stm.GPIOA + stm.GPIO_BSRR`` is the absolute "
"address of ``GPIOA->BSRR``."
msgstr ""
"Tel een absolute basis en een registeroffset op om het volledige adres van "
"een enkel register te krijgen. Bijvoorbeeld ``stm.GPIOA + stm.GPIO_BSRR`` is"
" het absolute adres van ``GPIOA->BSRR``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:66
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Voorbeeld::"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:77
msgid "Representative constants"
msgstr "Representatieve constanten"

#: ../../library/stm.rst:79
msgid ""
"The selection below covers one entry per major peripheral category, picked "
"so the naming convention is clear at a glance. Every other CMSIS symbol for "
"the build target is also available on the module -- see :func:`__getattr__` "
"below for the type-checker fallback."
msgstr ""
"De onderstaande selectie omvat één vermelding per belangrijke "
"randapparaatcategorie, zo gekozen dat de naamgevingsconventie in één "
"oogopslag duidelijk is. Elk ander CMSIS-symbool voor het build-doel is "
"eveneens beschikbaar op de module -- zie :func:`__getattr__` hieronder voor "
"de fallback voor typecontroleurs."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:87
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``GPIOA`` peripheral. ``GPIOB`` ... ``GPIOK`` (range "
"depends on the MCU package) follow the same pattern."
msgstr ""
"Basisadres van het ``GPIOA``\\ -randapparaat. ``GPIOB`` ... ``GPIOK`` (het "
"bereik hangt af van de MCU-behuizing) volgen hetzelfde patroon."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:93
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``USART1`` peripheral. Other USART / UART instances are "
"exposed under ``USART2``, ``USART3``, ``UART4`` ... as available."
msgstr ""
"Basisadres van het ``USART1``\\ -randapparaat. Andere USART-/UART-instanties"
" worden beschikbaar gesteld onder ``USART2``\\ , ``USART3``\\ , ``UART4`` "
"... voor zover beschikbaar."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:99
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``SPI1`` peripheral. Additional SPI instances appear as "
"``SPI2``, ``SPI3``, ... up to the MCU's count."
msgstr ""
"Basisadres van het ``SPI1``\\ -randapparaat. Aanvullende SPI-instanties "
"verschijnen als ``SPI2``\\ , ``SPI3``\\ , ... tot het aantal van de MCU."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:105
msgid "Base address of the ``I2C1`` peripheral. ``I2C2`` ... ``I2C4`` follow."
msgstr ""
"Basisadres van het ``I2C1``\\ -randapparaat. ``I2C2`` ... ``I2C4`` volgen."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:110
msgid ""
"Base address of the ``TIM1`` advanced-control timer. General-purpose and "
"basic timers (``TIM2`` ... ``TIM17`` as available) follow the same naming."
msgstr ""
"Basisadres van de ``TIM1`` advanced-control timer. General-purpose en "
"basistimers (\\ ``TIM2`` ... ``TIM17`` voor zover beschikbaar) volgen "
"dezelfde naamgeving."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:116
msgid ""
"Base address of ``ADC1``. ``ADC2`` / ``ADC3`` appear on MCUs with multiple "
"ADC blocks."
msgstr ""
"Basisadres van ``ADC1``\\ . ``ADC2`` / ``ADC3`` verschijnen op MCU's met "
"meerdere ADC-blokken."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:122
msgid "Base address of the DAC peripheral, on MCUs that have one."
msgstr "Basisadres van het DAC-randapparaat, op MCU's die er een hebben."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:127
msgid ""
"Base address of ``DMA1``. ``DMA2`` is present on most STM32s; H7-class parts"
" also expose ``BDMA``, ``MDMA`` and (on the N6) ``HPDMA`` / ``GPDMA``."
msgstr ""
"Basisadres van ``DMA1``\\ . ``DMA2`` is aanwezig op de meeste STM32's; "
"H7-klasse onderdelen stellen ook ``BDMA``\\ , ``MDMA`` en (op de N6) "
"``HPDMA`` / ``GPDMA`` beschikbaar."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:134
msgid "Base address of the Reset and Clock Control peripheral."
msgstr "Basisadres van het Reset and Clock Control-randapparaat."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:139
msgid "Base address of the External Interrupt / Event Controller."
msgstr "Basisadres van de External Interrupt / Event Controller."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:144
msgid ""
"Base address of the embedded flash controller (the peripheral, not the flash"
" array itself)."
msgstr ""
"Basisadres van de embedded flashcontroller (het randapparaat, niet de flash-"
"array zelf)."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:150
msgid "Base address of the System Configuration Controller."
msgstr "Basisadres van de System Configuration Controller."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:155
msgid "Base address of the Power Control peripheral."
msgstr "Basisadres van het Power Control-randapparaat."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:160
msgid "Offset of the GPIO bit set/reset register within any ``GPIOx`` base."
msgstr ""
"Offset van het GPIO bit set/reset-register binnen een willekeurige "
"``GPIOx``\\ -basis."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:165
msgid "Offset of the GPIO input data register."
msgstr "Offset van het GPIO-invoergegevensregister."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:170
msgid "Offset of the GPIO output data register."
msgstr "Offset van het GPIO-uitvoergegevensregister."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:175
msgid "Offset of the USART/UART control register 1."
msgstr "Offset van het USART/UART-controleregister 1."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:180
msgid "Offset of the timer control register 1."
msgstr "Offset van het timer-controleregister 1."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:185
msgid ""
"Offset of the timer capture/compare register 1. ``TIM_CCR2`` ... "
"``TIM_CCR4`` follow on timers that have multiple channels."
msgstr ""
"Offset van het timer capture/compare-register 1. ``TIM_CCR2`` ... "
"``TIM_CCR4`` volgen op timers die meerdere kanalen hebben."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:191
msgid "Offset of the RCC clock control register."
msgstr "Offset van het RCC-klokcontroleregister."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:196
msgid "Offset of the RCC clock configuration register."
msgstr "Offset van het RCC-klokconfiguratieregister."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:200
msgid ""
"Dynamic-attribute fallback: any CMSIS symbol exposed by the firmware that "
"isn't individually listed above (e.g. ``stm.FDCAN1``, ``stm.OCTOSPI1``, "
"``stm.GPIO_AFR``, the various bit-field shifts and masks, ...) still "
"resolves to its absolute address or offset as an ``int``."
msgstr ""
"Fallback voor dynamische attributen: elk CMSIS-symbool dat door de firmware "
"beschikbaar wordt gesteld en hierboven niet afzonderlijk is vermeld (bijv. "
"``stm.FDCAN1``\\ , ``stm.OCTOSPI1``\\ , ``stm.GPIO_AFR``\\ , de diverse "
"bitveldverschuivingen en -maskers, ...) wordt nog steeds omgezet naar zijn "
"absolute adres of offset als een ``int``\\ ."

#: ../../library/stm.rst:205
msgid ""
"The runtime module populates these symbols directly into its globals dict at"
" import time, so ``__getattr__`` is never actually invoked. The signature is"
" exposed solely so static type checkers (Pyright, Pylance, mypy) accept "
"``stm.<any CMSIS name>`` without a \"module has no attribute\" diagnostic."
msgstr ""
"De runtime-module vult deze symbolen rechtstreeks in zijn globals-dict bij "
"het importeren, dus ``__getattr__`` wordt nooit daadwerkelijk aangeroepen. "
"De signatuur wordt uitsluitend beschikbaar gesteld zodat statische "
"typecontroleurs (Pyright, Pylance, mypy) ``stm.<any CMSIS name>`` accepteren"
" zonder een \"module has no attribute\"-diagnose."
